## Decisions and Action Items

- **`draft-ietf-intarea-legacy-registries`**: Chairs will start Working Group Last Call (WGLC) on the mailing list.
- **`draft-ietf-intarea-dhcp-rate-signaling`**: Chairs will launch a two-week consensus check on the mailing list regarding the proposed scope reduction to DHCPv6-only.
- **IP Tunnels Draft**: Authors are required to submit an updated version addressing review comments by December 11; failure to do so will result in moving the document out of active working group draft status.
- **DNS Protocol WG Chartering**: INT Area ADs will move forward with IESG evaluation and community last call for chartering the new DNS protocol WG.

