## Next Steps

- **Internet Checksum Draft**: Author will continue refining the document based on working group feedback.
- **ICMP Interface Identification (`draft-mitchell-intarea-5837bis`)**: Authors will publish version 03 incorporating list feedback, address IPv6 next-hop representation for IPv4 routes, and add security considerations before adoption consideration.
- **ICMP Acceptable Use Policy**: Ron Bonica will refine the document scope, considering feedback to transition toward informational guidance rather than normative policy constraints.
- **IP Enclave Boundary Signaling**: Eric Kline will review terminology (replacing "enclave") and coordinate with the SCHC working group regarding sleeping/intermittent node signaling.